MASTER AI DEVELOPMENT PROMPT

Project: AbroadConnect India — India's Global Opportunity Community

Project Type: Full-stack web application, mobile-responsive PWA, future Flutter mobile app

1. Project Vision

Act as a senior full-stack software architect, UI/UX designer, product manager, database engineer, and cybersecurity specialist.

Build a production-oriented, secure, scalable, modern community platform called AbroadConnect India (working name).

The platform connects people across India who are planning to move abroad for higher education, employment, apprenticeships, vocational training, scholarships, research, entrepreneurship, or relocation.

It also connects prospective applicants with verified students, professionals, mentors, and Indian community members already living abroad.

The primary objective is to reduce misinformation, isolation, scams, and fragmented guidance by creating a trusted, structured, country-specific community.

Core principles:

Community-first rather than consultant-first

Free access to essential guidance

Trust, transparency, and verified information

Inclusive of students from all Indian states, cities, and educational backgrounds

Support for English, Hindi, and regional languages

Mobile-first, accessible, Gen Z-friendly experience

No guaranteed visas, admissions, scholarships, or jobs

Privacy and safety by design

Do not create a static demonstration. Build functional screens, database-backed workflows, authenticated APIs, permission checks, and real interactions.

